   "text": "BoardFlight（boardflight.com）是一個美國機場出發時間規劃網站。它的用途是告訴你「最晚該幾點抵達機場」。根據官網介紹，",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "BoardFlight starts from one specific flight and works backward through every step to the curb. ",
     "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIFRgCIiRlODM2MzNjOS1iOWU0LTQzMDgtOTY5ZS02MjU5ZGUwMWFjMjMSDNZlIezKCYSJ959LVxoMds5El3jPy74WFT57IjAJ//8RuRrTLjHdWY8q2i42Oeqcj3G3ptHIDuJ9Arqat3qBSTpxdgRoiFr6Eg+KgCcqE1zMnhX4SH/l1BmHraSxlRz65lAYBA==",
     "title": "BoardFlight — the time to arrive for any US flight",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://www.boardflight.com/"
    }
   ],
   "text": "它從一個特定航班出發，逐步往回推算到路邊下車處",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "text": "，並考量",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "Your terminal, your security lane, and how that airport runs at your hour.\n\n",
     "encrypted_index": "Eo8BCioIFRgCIiRlODM2MzNjOS1iOWU0LTQzMDgtOTY5ZS02MjU5ZGUwMWFjMjMSDJpM2JVC1DEp6XKIHRoMsJFpWi4FDiEQWiTRIjBmIb+z9LCVItPSSPtpBpk0Tatw/STPi++lYdfchVf6LodtxEG7tjQLRpy95gDTwMMqE5FFCw9pcQ7yO4UB+AQ2izfKse0YBA==",
     "title": "BoardFlight — the time to arrive for any US flight",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://www.boardflight.com/"
    }
   ],
   "text": "航廈、安檢通道，以及該機場在你出發時段的運作情況",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "text": "。使用方式是輸入航班號碼，系統就會",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "citations": [
    {
     "cited_text": "Enter a flight number and get one arrive-by time, worked out from that airport's terminal layout, security profile, and the hour you fly.\n\n",
     "encrypted_index": "EpABCioIFRgCIiRlODM2MzNjOS1iOWU0LTQzMDgtOTY5ZS02MjU5ZGUwMWFjMjMSDMnFJSmiKWJRw2ZbXBoMk9TWhJi8uC+oV5iXIjCzZ3tANMHZ1IqcndW8aVs2Mj5Ixz7nrqwaT8RswXIMXnY6Od5vYXTpC+HrOQHqdXYqFMgdIKT5D0ctQ1u89l5xwnT/2nc8GAQ=",
     "title": "BoardFlight — the time to arrive for any US flight",
     "type": "web_search_result_location",
     "url": "https://www.boardflight.com/"
    }
   ],
   "text": "根據該機場的航廈配置、安檢狀況，以及你的起飛時段，給出一個建議抵達時間",
   "type": "text"
  },
